From: Karen Whitfield
To: Dave Morgan
Subj: Re: 2400 baud is here!!!
Date: 10-24-89 06:50

> I have promised to read offline.  Somebody tell me what that means.

It means: in TERM, press Alt-L before you read the message base and give
it a file name.  Everything that scrolls by gets saved.  Hang up, then
read the file at your leisure with TYPE FILE.TXT | MORE, or in EDIT.
Your boat-owning executive will have to settle for a rowboat.

KW
