From: Harold Pruitt
To: Maria Delgado
Subj: Re: The Barrel Shifter wants YOU
Date: 01-17-90 08:40

> funny stories (Harold, I know you have railroad stories)

I do.  I have one about a signal relay, a family of possums and a very
confused train crew in 1958.  It is 3 pages long typed.  I have typed it
on the computer, using EDIT, which I found in the DOS directory by
myself, thank you very much.

