@@23
From: Maria Delgado
To: Harold Pruitt
Subj: Re: The Barrel Shifter wants YOU
Date: 01-17-90 19:05

> Please explain as if to a signal engineer.

Think of it as a train leaving your yard for mine.  At the Main Menu
press F (files), then U (upload), then Z (ZMODEM).  The BBS will say it
is waiting.  In TERM, press PgUp, choose Zmodem, and type the file's
name, like C:\POSSUMS.TXT.  Your file departs.  When the BBS says "Got
it", the train has arrived.  All clear, green board.

Possums!  I can't wait.

Maria
