Date: 10-17-90 22:41

A year ago tonight I brought home my ARM/AT and asked if anyone else had
one.  Since then I've learned what the TURBO button does, what a
register is (sort of), how to read offline (mostly), and that a Stray
Pointer can kill a level 4 (Susan, it gets better).

I've also run up a long-distance bill that Linda has taped to the
refrigerator as "a warning to others".

